{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "story_grabds_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_grabds_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "Reliving Old Dreams",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_grabds_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "317a6e72d980627afe608b45e1209bd7003fff10b5c7c6bc352a2792b6edbcdb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The wind blows gently, tugging your sleeves like a mischievous child.\nIt brings many scents to share: the earthy aroma of freshly squeezed rapeseed oil, the crisp freshness of neatly stacked rice straws, and the fragrance of rice stir-fried in the pan.\nAnd so, you know all that is happening in these fields."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "38_g20_skyblue_L1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shu said she passed through fields like these on her way from Dahuang to Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mischievous Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are they wheat fields?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not just wheat, but also rice, sorghum, and sometimes just wild grass, many plants whose names I don't know, all growing so tall."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A narrow dirt road extended out from the field. It had just rained, and there were pesky mud pits all over the place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, Grain Buds, please, no rain!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Alright. It was sunny."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g16_sunnyday_R2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It was sunny, and the bugs and fowlbeasts chirped happily."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's right. The sun made the grass nice and toasty. Bugs that can't take the heat went to hide in the shade."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcounty"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sounds so nice..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dozing off already? Don't forget you promised to go to bed after this story, all of you. The doctors say you need to get lots of sleep."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mischievous Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about you, Grain Buds? Are you going to bed, or are you gonna wait for Shu?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She won't be coming today because she has so much to do. I'll get some rest too, once you all fall asleep. I don't want this cold to get any worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Keep going, Grain Buds—we'll be good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A truck came rolling from afar, filled with fresh grain, and a thick layer of straw on top."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mischievous Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why is there straw on top?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The young farmer driving the truck was in a hurry to get the food to the granary. He put a layer of straw over the grain, just in case it rained."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But he's worried..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why is there a dark cloud following me on a sunny day?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I need to go faster. If it rains..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wh-What happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry, no one got hurt. But he found that the road before him was blocked as soon as he turned the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whose stockbeast and burdenbeast are these? Get them out of the way!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But nobody answered."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He walked up to the burdenbeast, but there was no bridle on its neck, nor tag on its ears. The stockbeast had a saddle, but he couldn't get it to move, no matter how hard he pulled."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The dark cloud got closer. The anxious farmer got an idea and pulled a handful of straw from the truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here! You can have this, if you come over here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Over here, over here—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Burdenbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Even the animals ignored him!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mischievous Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What did he do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why wouldn't they move?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What do I do? My grain will be ruined if it rains!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait, this isn't a trap to rob me, right? Is there somebody hiding in the trees?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He was just imagining things."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Go! Shoo! Get lost!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I think I have a whip in my truck for cutting through dense grass."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Grain Buds..."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The young farmer took out the whip, but hesitated. The burdenbeast and stockbeast looked at him placidly, without fear, without moving.\nThe dark cloud drifted ever closer.\nHe raised his whip up high—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stop!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Girl Passing By",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Stop! I can get them out of the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mischievous Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, how come you're in the story, Grain Buds?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not me, just a girl who happened to pass by. I'm just, er, playing her part."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're so docile, how could you bear to whip them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What do you suggest, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Simple. I'll just ask politely. I've got a lot of experience."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You can talk to animals?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The girl who just happened to pass by walked over to the animals and leaned in to listen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, kid—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, what are they saying?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Moo?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I... I can't understand them anymore!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mischievous Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_976_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, Grain Buds!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mischievous Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_976_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No fair! How come you put yourself in the story? You weren't there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I told you, it's not me, just a girl who happened to pass by. Must be a student from a nearby school."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mischievous Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_976_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, what's her name, then? Was she in the story when Shu told it to you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You ask too many questions!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Here, you're in the story too! What are you supposed to be, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mischievous Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_976_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm a tree! Watch me rain leaves on your head!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is it true that you can talk to animals, Grain Buds?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course it's true. I've told you so many stories. Did you think I could come up with them all by myself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Does the girl who just happened to pass by understand animals too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Can I learn to talk to animals?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, I've asked a lot of people. Shu, Big Buffalo, and the Doctor. As for the answer..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eager Children",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You can do it, as long as you put your heart into it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Some animals are very stubborn. It's not easy to get them to talk to people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But once you understand what they're trying to do, you can understand what they're saying."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Understand what they're trying to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm in no mood for jokes!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The grain in this cart is a new species from Dahuang! The old man at the granary will kill me if it gets wet!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dahuang? Oh yeah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look at the tag on the stockbeast's neck! It came from Dahuang!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Looks like it. How did it get here? It's a long way from Dahuang."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, I recognize you. You were pregnant at the time, and you were following in the rear of the pack, leisurely eating grass and basking in the sun."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's with all these wounds? What happened to your baby? Did you get separated?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Moo."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The stockbeast bowed her head. The silent burdenbeast took a step towards it, and they cuddled together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you come to find your baby?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry, I'll help you find it. Can you tell me about your baby?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's a good child."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Children",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It talked!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It has large, round eyes. We call it Roundie."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Most of the time, it was quiet and content, following us closely."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's a strong child, keeping up with us on its trembling legs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Does Roundie look like you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Very much, but not at all to your eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's so small and likable... it hangs on to our shoulders lightly with its claws when it sits on us, so as not to hurt us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But how did you get separated?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's not its fault..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We had to leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Leave Dahuang? Why? If you were looking for fresher pastures, you only needed to go as far as the river bank."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We kept walking. When there was no path in the hills and rivers, we walked over them by stepping on rocks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But our baby was separated from us along the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Burdenbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you won't move until you find your calf?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Have you any idea how far Dahuang is from here? How long is that search gonna be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look at that dark cloud! It could rain at any moment!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Say something, girl!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How about... how about you two move out of the way and let him pass? I'll stay and help you look for your baby."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No. There is another reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why won't the burdenbeast talk? Is he here to look for the baby?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He cannot talk to you yet, for the same reason... a reason that you have not figured out yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The young farmer sat down and cocked his head, looking at the dark cloud that was gradually descending, casting a shadow over the trees, road, burdenbeast, stockbeast, and humans."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you sleepy? Should we stop here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mischievous Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_976_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No! You're just getting to the good part!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shh, keep your voice down, the young ones over there are asleep."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You can tell it to me quiet, Grain Buds! What did the lost baby look like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The doctor who brought me to Rhodes Island said I have eyes like my mother... does the calf look like its parents?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mischievous Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_976_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If stockbeasts can talk, their baby can look like anything. It's just a story, no need to care so much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Timid Child",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, I DO care!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Shh—do you want to hear what happened next or not? I promise that you'll find out what the calf looks like soon enough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What are you muttering to yourself over there? I thought you said you could fix this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm working on it. She should be here like, now... let's wait a little longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What? That rain isn't waiting for anybody!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just give me a sec!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sorry. If you don't have a way... I'll have to use my whip."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait, she's here! Over there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A Xian came by the road.\nShe had a few strands of millet in her hand, and there were a few muddy spots on her pants."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you going to the granary?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes, Exalted Xian! It's about to rain, and I have to hurry. Look over there..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You mean the dark cloud? Don't worry, it won't rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And there's no need to hurry... the road up ahead has collapsed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Collapsed? How can that be? There shouldn't be any floods in this season."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Which makes it all the more difficult to predict. Perhaps it was already damaged a few years ago by the mountain fissure, and it finally gave way today."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You saved his life by blocking the path."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Moo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You knew the road ahead would collapse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mm-hm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Is that the other reason?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Partly. He's not the only one we're trying to help."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Burdenbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1163_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yes. Now that you are aware of the danger ahead, it's time for us to go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait! I've figured out the other reason, haven't I? Why doesn't he want to talk to me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blocking Stockbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1244_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Some words do not need to be said out loud to be understood."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As if just realizing something, the farmer grabbed a bunch of grain from his truck and chased after the burdenbeast and stockbeast."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait! Thank you! I want you to have this!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*huff* *huff* Wh-Why can't I catch them, even though they're walking so slowly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Those that are gone will remain beyond your grasp. It is the way of things. There is no need for regret."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look, the dark cloud is gone, just as I told you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g16_sunnyday_R1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dark cloud was indeed gone, and sunlight shined through where it once was.\nThe young farmer panted with his hands on his knee, but he did not drop a single grain.\nSuddenly, there was a sound from the truck. A little beastling poked its head out, then jumped from the cargo bed. It looked just like a dark cloud.\nApparently just woken up, it shook a bunch of straw off itself, having no idea how it got here."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_outcounty"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I smell Mommy and Daddy! Where are they?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The young storm cloudbeast ran a few circles around the truck, leaping up and down."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where's Mommy and Daddy? Where am I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you... Roundie?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know me? Hey, you look familiar... have I met you before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why were you on the truck?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know. I just took a nap in a haystack because the sun was really warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When I woke up, Mommy and Daddy were nowhere to be found! But I could smell them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They were just here! They're not far away! Look!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your mommy and daddy!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I... I don't recognize them. I only remember their scent."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How could you not recognize them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your eyes are big and round, just like that stockbeast."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't remember!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But they do... they said you were quiet and content when you were little, always following close behind them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They said your legs trembled, but you kept walking forward."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They said that when you sat on their shoulders, you always grabbed lightly with your claws so you wouldn't hurt them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Th-That's me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The little storm cloudbeast spun around anxiously, on the verge of tears."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I haven't seen them in years!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your mommy and daddy are over there! I'll take you to them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The storm cloudbeast jumped into Grain Buds's arms. She sniffed and ran towards the burdenbeast and stockbeast under the red clouds.\nShe ran and yelled—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I found your baby!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The silent burdenbeast seemed to hear her, and stopped in its tracks, turning around to wait.\nGrain Buds picked up her pace and tried to bring the storm cloudbeast to the burdenbeast.\nBut she simply could not close the distance with the burdenbeast, no matter how hard she tried."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I-It's no use. You can't catch them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stray Storm Cloudbeast",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_599_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're... gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the burdenbeast was just standing there. It never left.\nGrain Buds was exhausted and came to a stop, panting heavily. In the sunset, the shadows were stretched long and thin, like lines of ink that never fade."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will do it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I will take Roundie to her parents. I will make her recognize them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A-Are you really a Xian?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's no such thing as Xians. We're all the same: ordinary people who care with our hearts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Isn't that so, girl who just happened to pass by?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Girl Passing By",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "With our hearts... that's how we hear animals and recognize lost loved ones, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Girl Passing By",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "In that case, I'll leave Roundie in your hands."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Passing Xian",
      "speakerId": "avg_2025_shu_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No need to worry. I promise..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're back! What about the calf?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Girl Passing By",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I left it to the Xian. She'll get Roundie to her mommy and daddy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Girl Passing By",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Say, can I hitch a ride?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sure. Where are you going?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If it's not going to rain, I'm in no hurry. I plan to turn around and go to the granary by another way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Girl Passing By",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll go there too! I'll find another way to Dahuang from the granary."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Young Farmer",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_303_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dahuang, eh? That's a long way. Maybe you'll run into that stockbeast and burdenbeast again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g13_afterglow_L1"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The girl who happened to pass by jumped onto the truck, into the thick layer of straw. Putting her arms behind her head, she gazed at the clouds in the sky.\nThe trucks started moving. Swaying in the wind, the straws tickled her face, but she did not mind.\nThe straw, made nice and toasty by the sun, was like the fur of a stockbeast past autumn, taking her into its gentle embrace.\nShe felt like she was sleeping on top of a stockbeast... or perhaps a burdenbeast, or a storm cloudbeast.\nZzz—"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gentle Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Asleep already, Grain Buds?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Exalted Xian..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gentle Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, your blanket's come off again. Got to cover up with your blanket to get better quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Remember me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mommy... Daddy... please... recognize me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gentle Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You've grown again. This blanket's getting small for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Grain Buds",
      "speakerId": "avg_4122_grabds_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Zzz—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gentle Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sleep, Grain Buds. Sweet dreams."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gentle Voice",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll stay by your side, until you wake."
